      "name": "",
      "created_at": "2026-03-06T03:23:14.809Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi, I have margin &amp; discount applied randomly when it is not intended in purchase receipt and purchase invoice.</p>\n<p>This started when I start to apply manage stock to existing items and use purchase receipts to those items and some unmanaged stock items.</p>\n<p>Sometimes the rate have discounts, sometimes margins, with value that I cannot find the pattern yet.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/a/5acce2412ac90ecabe93812a4cd9b23ba639ccf0.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/5acce2412ac90ecabe93812a4cd9b23ba639ccf0\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/a/5acce2412ac90ecabe93812a4cd9b23ba639ccf0_2_690x361.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"cXfVTNSW4jkxa4lp4rME70ngfcs\" width=\"690\" height=\"361\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/a/5acce2412ac90ecabe93812a4cd9b23ba639ccf0_2_690x361.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/a/5acce2412ac90ecabe93812a4cd9b23ba639ccf0_2_1035x541.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/a/5acce2412ac90ecabe93812a4cd9b23ba639ccf0_2_1380x722.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FAF6F7\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1560×818 75.3 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>I didn’t change rate manually, it is applied as I select items in items table. Sometimes rate is higher, sometimes lower than price list rate.</p>\n<p>What may be the root cause, and what is the solution?</p>",
