      "username": "mangroliya",
      "name": "",
      "created_at": "2026-03-06T07:08:20.613Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi,</p>\n<p>This is happenig due to entered rate is different than Price List rate. System will calculate discounting amount from the difference of Price List rate and entered rate on Purchase Order or Purchase Receipts.</p>\n<p>Hope this is helpful.</p>\n<p>Regards,</p>\n<p>Divyesh Mangroliya</p>",
